cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "FactBench: a deterministic factual-consistency benchmark for clinical note generation"
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "Heidi Health"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-30
abstract: >
  25 fully synthetic clinical consultation transcripts with consensus-built,
  arbitrated gold fact sets and a deterministic, self-contained verifier
  (coverage of must-cover facts, zero critical errors, safety signals).
